OL,3,GNEWSAResidents rally to protect tree
OL,4,Afrom development
OL,5,
OL,6,FResidents are opposing plans to fell an
OL,7,Fold beech tree as part of a wider
OL,8,Fapplication to build 450 homes.
OL,10,FSkerningham Estates Ltd submitted a
OL,11,Fhybrid planning application for the
OL,12,Finitial part of the the Skerningham
OL,13,FGarden Village development which would
OL,14,Finvolve the felling of the tree known
OL,15,Flocally as the Barmpton Beech.
OL,17,FResident Judith Murray said the tree
OL,18,Fhas stood there proudly for more than
OL,19,F100 years and it was "very much loved
OL,20,Fnot only by residents of Whinfield but
OL,21,Fthose who visit from other areas".
OL,23,APub: 06-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,394,390,260,160,0,100
