OL,3,GNEWSAResidents rally to protect tree
OL,4,Afrom development
OL,5,
OL,6,FA spokesperson for Skerningham Estates
OL,7,Fsaid the loss of the beech needed to be
OL,8,Fconsidered against the benefits of the
OL,9,Fproject and committed to providing
OL,10,F1,200 new trees.
